.TH TAM-EDIT 1 "November 2026" "tam-edit 1.0.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tam-edit \- terminal text editor in C17
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tam-edit
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fI+LINE[:COL]\fR] [\fIFILE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tam-edit
is a terminal text editor written in C17, linking only \fBlibtam\fR and the C
standard library. It provides multi-tab and split-pane editing, grouped undo,
selections, multi-cursor editing, UTF-8 and legacy encodings via \fBiconv\fR,
regex search and replace, syntax highlighting for 158 embedded definitions,
25 embedded colorschemes, and interactive shell commands.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B +LINE[:COL]
Jump to 1-based \fILINE\fR (and optional 1-based \fICOL\fR) when opening the first file.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a summary of default keybindings and command-line options.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print the \fBtam-edit\fR and \fBlibtam\fR versions and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-check\-config " [\fIPATH\fR]"
Validate \fIsettings.ini\fR (or \fIPATH\fR) and exit with status 0 if valid.
.TP
.BR \-\-import\-micro\-config " [\fIDIR\fR]"
Import \fIsettings.json\fR and \fIbindings.json\fR from \fIDIR\fR (default
\fI~/.config/micro\fR) into \fItam-edit\fR INI format.
.TP
.BR \-\-dump\-syntax " \fIFILE\fR"
Print per-line syntax highlight spans for \fIFILE\fR and exit.
.SH KEYBINDINGS
.TP
.B Ctrl+E / Ctrl+G
Open the command palette / show keybinding guidance.
.TP
.B Ctrl+N / Ctrl+O / Ctrl+S
New untitled tab / open a file / save.
.TP
.B Ctrl+D / Ctrl+Q
Close the current split or tab / quit the editor.
.TP
.B Ctrl+F / Ctrl+R / Ctrl+U
Find / replace / reload the active file.
.TP
.B Alt+J / Alt+Shift+J
Find next / previous match.
.TP
.B Alt+T / Alt+Shift+T
Next / previous tab.
.TP
.B Ctrl+C / Ctrl+X / Ctrl+V / Ctrl+K
Copy / cut / paste / delete the current line.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y
Undo / redo.
.TP
.B Alt+M
Toggle the selection anchor. Move the cursor to extend the selection.
Use Alt+, and Alt+. for word movement, Alt+< and Alt+> for buffer
boundaries, and Alt+Backspace and Alt+D for word deletion.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B TAM_EDIT_CONFIG_HOME
Override the configuration directory (default: \fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tam-edit\fR
or \fI~/.config/tam-edit\fR).
.TP
.B TAM_EDIT_TRUECOLOR
Set to \fB1\fR to force 24-bit truecolor output.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/tam-edit/settings.ini
INI configuration file with \fB[settings]\fR and \fB[bindings]\fR sections.
.TP
.I ~/.config/tam-edit/syntax/*.yaml
User syntax definition overrides.
